    "description": "Ajahn Brahmali to deliver special Dhamma Talk in Sri Lanka tomorrow",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Ajahn-Brahmali-to-deliver-special-Dhamma-Talk-in-Sri-Lanka-tomorrow/56-791275",
