    "description": "Govt. to roll out housing and religious site restoration programs for Cyclone Ditwah victims",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-to-roll-out-housing-and-religious-site-restoration-programs-for-Cyclone-Ditwah-victims/56-791277",
    "lang": "en",
