    "chunk_size_bytes": 1201,
    "chunk_text": "Unforgettable evening \u2026 with Rukshan\n\nKnown for his incredible range as a composer, multi-instrumentalist, recording artiste, and international performer, Rukshan Perera is working on giving music lovers an unforgettable evening with his unique blend of jazz, world music, and soul.\n\nYes, from masterful jazz scat to his iconic harmony whistling, his performance, on the evening of Saturday, 21st June, will be both technically brilliant and deeply moving.\n\nThe venue will be the Bishop\u2019s College Auditorium and Rukshan will have for support several guest artistes, promising rich collaborations and musical surprises throughout the night.\n\nThis concert is being held in aid of RCU Loyalty Pledge Scholarships for students and that means while you enjoy an action-packed evening, you will also be supporting a great cause.\n\nWhat\u2019s more, those who turn up to see one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most versatile and celebrated musicians in action will also get a chance to take home Rukshan\u2019s CD and two Live DVDs!\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
