    "description": "Compassion over capital: Janashakthi partners President\u2019s Fund to transform child healthcare access",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/compassion-over-capital-janashakthi-partners-presidents-fund-to-transform-child-healthcare-access/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
