    "md5": "85deedd45b7c873fcbffcdba786a5210",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1837,
    "chunk_text": "K+ by Helanka named Strongest Footwear Brand of the Year at Platinum Excellence Awards 2026\n\nK+ by Helanka has been awarded the Strongest Footwear Brand of the Year at the Platinum Excellence Awards 2026, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most recognized platforms for industry achievement, marking a defining moment in the brand\u2019s continued rise across the country\u2019s footwear market.\n\nThe award reflects a deliberate strategy built around three pillars: product quality, design relevance, and distribution reach. Over the past year, K+ has expanded its retail presence, introduced new collections and strengthened its supply chain to ensure consistent availability nationwide.\n\n\u201cThis recognition belongs to every person who helped build K+ into what it is today, our teams, our retail partners and most importantly, our customers. It motivates us to hold ourselves to an even higher standard going forward.\u201d \u2013 Helanka team\n\nBehind the award is a cross-functional effort spanning product development, design, logistics and retail execution. K+\u2019s ability to scale while maintaining quality has been central to earning the loyalty of a broad and diverse customer base across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe brand also credits its partner network across supply chains, distribution and retail for enabling the consistency and reach that this recognition reflects.\n\nIn addition, K+ by Helanka has been actively contributing to the growth of the local footwear industry through initiatives such as the Colombo International Shoe Fair, conducted annually across different districts in Sri Lanka. This initiative has played a key role in supporting industry development, driving economic activity and strengthening market access for stakeholders across the value chain further reinforcing the significance of this award as a milestone achievement for the brand."
  },
