    "description": "The real enemy is already logged in.  A wake-up call for Sri Lanka\u2019s boardrooms",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-real-enemy-is-already-logged-in-A-wake-up-call-for-Sri-Lanka-s-boardrooms/4-791543",
