    "chunk_size_bytes": 1858,
    "chunk_text": "Macktiles expands footprint  to Attidiya with new showroom\n\nMacksons Holdings Group Managing Director Mizver Makeen ceremonially opening the latest Macktiles showroom in Attidiya, Dehiwala\n\nMacktiles Lanka Ltd., has announced the launch of its latest showroom located at 236, Main Road, Attidiya, Dehiwala (opposite the Commercial Bank).\n\nThe grand opening for the new showroom, now bringing the latest in Macktiles\u2019 innovation and technology to the residents of Attidiya, was held on 24 April 2026, graced by the presence of Macksons Holdings Ltd.\u2019s leadership, showroom staff, as well as customers and well-wishers.\n\nThe distinguished invitees included Macksons Holdings Group Chairman Milfer Makeen, Managing Director Mizver Makeen, Chief Executive Officer Shimmer Milfer and Senior Vice President Nilrukshi de Silva.\n\nAlso in attendance were Macksons Tiles Lanka Ltd., Chief Operating Officer Ahamed Shafee, Macktiles Lanka Ltd., Sales General Manager Niroshan Pananwala, Macksons Tiles Lanka Ltd., Head of Finance Aaqil Farzah, Macksons Paints Lanka Ltd., Sales General Manager Mihiran Opatha and Attidiya Branch Franchisee Holder Danushka Fernando.\n\nMacksons Holdings Group Managing Director Mizver Makeen said: \u201cThis strategic expansion of our footprint opens the door for our valued customers of the Attidiya-Dehiwala area, granting them access to a world class, innovation-driven variety of high-quality ceramic tiles for commercial and domestic applications.\u201d\n\nMoreover, this new showroom also introduced the implementation of technology, to further tailor its offerings to suit the exact needs and desires of its loyal customers.\n\nThe showroom opening also highlighted Macktiles\u2019 all-new 4x2 range, reintroduced its premium Batik collection, and also unveiled Macktiles\u2019 Junior Range (Kids range) as well as the Macktiles Green series."
