    "md5": "f0177ee4bd637f232ad8b525f26a47f7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1907,
    "chunk_text": "Ravi K\u2019s stark assessment of emerging picture\n\nNew Democratic Front (NDF) MP and former UNP Finance Minister and Minister of Power and Energy Ravi Karunanayake delivers a stark assessment of Sri Lanka\u2019s economic and governance crisis, warning that the country remains financially fragile amid weak growth, mounting external debt pressures, and inadequate safeguards in an increasingly digital economy.\n\nIn this interview with the Sunday Island, he criticizes what he calls the government\u2019s \u201csystem maintenance\u201d approach under President Anura Kumara Dissanayake, highlights the absence of investment and pro-growth policies, and calls for sweeping reforms to the Central Bank. He also raises concerns over energy policy missteps, fiscal constraints, and the need for unified political leadership to drive sustainable economic recovery.\n\nA: I believe our financial situation is precarious and highly vulnerable. This is largely because our systems have broken down during the transition to a digitalized world. In this shift from traditional approaches to digitization, we have failed to adequately safeguard the transformation against Cybercrime and other forms of technological intrusion. Sri Lanka is now in a position where we do not even know the true extent of the threat or when a serious cyber attack might occur.\n\nOn the political front, the government came to power promising a \u2018system change\u2019 and ambitious ideas for modernization. However, what we are witnessing is not a system change, but rather system maintenance. This so-called \u2018system maintenance\u2019 lacks the human capacity required to deliver meaningful results. At present, the entire political discourse appears to revolve around a single buzzword: AKD (Anura Kumara Dissanayake). In my view, this alone is insufficient to rescue an economy from bankruptcy or steer the country through the turbulent period we are facing."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-05-09-islandlk-9b229a0f",
    "num": "islandlk-9b229a0f",
    "date_str": "2026-05-09",
    "description": "Ravi K\u2019s stark assessment of emerging picture",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/ravi-ks-stark-assessment-of-emerging-picture/",
    "lang": "en",
