    "chunk_text": "Access Motors launches Range Rover Boutique Residency in Colombo\n\nTo deepen its engagement with luxury clients, Access Motors has launched a Range Rover Boutique Residency in Colombo, Sri Lanka. Located at ITC Rathnadeepa Colombo One Workplaces, the immersive space embodies the brand\u2019s modern luxury ethos through minimalist architecture and curated design. Unlike a traditional showroom, the boutique offers an intimate, highly personalized client journey. Trained specialists guide one-to-one consultations, showcasing the latest Range Rover models, bespoke configurations, and lifestyle selections.\n\nThe residency marks a strategic milestone in Range Rover\u2019s brand evolution, reinforcing its commitment to exclusive, experience-driven engagement in a calm, contemporary setting.\n\nIIHS and Akutagawa HRM launch pathway for Sri Lankan youth to build healthcare careers in Japan\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
