    "chunk_size_bytes": 1202,
    "chunk_text": "Thayalan Bartlett named APAC future leader\n\nThayalan Bartlett, Executive Chairman of MullenLowe Group Sri Lanka, has been named to Campaign Asia-Pacific\u2019s inaugural\u00a050 Over Fifty 2026\u00a0list. He is the only Sri Lankan recognized among 37 senior leaders across 11 APAC markets, celebrated for actively shaping the future of marketing, media, and communications. With over three decades of experience, Bartlett has guided his agency through national crises including the pandemic and Sri Lanka\u2019s debt crisis, while championing creativity, data, and technology. The honour challenges the industry\u2019s focus on youth, highlighting Bartlett\u2019s mentorship, entrepreneurial drive, and long-term institution-building. His inclusion places him alongside regional leaders from Edelman, Omnicom, and Microsoft Advertising, reinforcing the value of experienced leadership in a rapidly evolving communications landscape.\n\nIIHS and Akutagawa HRM launch pathway for Sri Lankan youth to build healthcare careers in Japan\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
