    "description": "Fair Comment files formal complaint seeking investigation into death of Kapila Chandrasena",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Fair-Comment-files-formal-complaint-seeking-investigation-into-death-of-Kapila-Chandrasena/56-791818",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
