    "description": "Beyond debt restructuring:  Sri Lanka\u2019s narrow window  to execute a real economic reset",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-debt-restructuring-Sri-Lanka-s-narrow-window-to-execute-a-real-economic-reset/4-791830",
    "lang": "en",
