    "description": "From administration to intelligence: A new paradigm for governance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-administration-to-intelligence-A-new-paradigm-for-governance/4-791887",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
