    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s withholding tax among world\u2019s lowest: Verit\u00e9 Research",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-s-withholding-tax-among-world-s-lowest-Verit\u00e9-Research/34-791892",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
