    "description": "President orders urgent resettlement of Ditwah victims in Nuwara Eliya",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/President-orders-urgent-resettlement-of-Ditwah-victims-in-Nuwara-Eliya/56-791897",
    "lang": "en",
