    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Cabinet-approves-Rs-1-8-m-additional-compensation-for-245-families-affected-by-Yan-Oya-Reservoir-project/56-791957",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
